  "Cargando pantalla de pago<span class=\"dots\"><span>.</span><span>.</span><span>.</span></span>": "Loading payment screen<span class=\"dots\"><span>.</span><span>.</span><span>.</span></span>",
  "¡Bienvenido a Premium!": "Welcome to Premium!",
  "Tu pago fue procesado exitosamente.<br> Sigue estos pasos para activar tu acceso en Havora.": "Your payment was processed successfully.<br> Follow these steps to activate your access in Havora.",
  "Cómo activar tu licencia": "How to activate your license",
  "<span class=\"step-n\">1</span> Abre Havora en tu computadora": "<span class=\"step-n\">1</span> Open Havora on your computer",
  "<span class=\"step-n\">2</span> Ve a <strong>Configuración → Licencia</strong>": "<span class=\"step-n\">2</span> Go to <strong>Settings → License</strong>",
  "<span class=\"step-n\">3</span> Ingresa el email con el que pagaste": "<span class=\"step-n\">3</span> Enter the email you paid with",
